gh to vanish into the dark that  doesn't really get around the fact that  surface-to-air missiles in battlefield 4  pretty much destroy a helicopter play  but it does help more of your  engagements on zaphod will be surprise  encounters so don't forget to pack your  night scopes one thing being showcased  well by night maps are just explosions  in general tracer rounds grenades and  other detonations look better than ever  night also headlights are now in play  and can be used to blind opponents  overall I'm still happy to drop in on  CTE every once in a while and see what  ideas dice la are cooking but i'll  probably be spending most of my time in  valve of hardline which launches next  week and star wars battlefront around  wintertime CTE seems to continue to  target battlefield 4 fans who may be put  off by hard lines cops and robbers  infantry focus gameplay and I imagine  dice la will continue to put their time  and effort into it to hold those fans  over into a battlefield 5 thanks for  watching and we'll see you soon in  battlefield hardline
 

